			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>belonging to an
				eclipse</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">signa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Manil. 4, 816</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">846</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 16,
				13, § 68</span></i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linea,</span>”
				<i>the ecliptic</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Serv. Verg. A. 10, 216</span></i>
			.</div>
